    <string name="letgo_msg_joy_1">Your joy rode the wind and spread far. May today\'s smile stay a while.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_joy_2">Good things grow when shared. May this joy reach tomorrow too.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_joy_3">Today\'s joy settled on the garden like sunlight.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_hope_1">A small wish flew off like a seed. Somewhere, it will sprout soon.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_hope_2">Hoping is already a step. Slowly, keep going.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_hope_3">The hope you sent today will light tomorrow\'s path.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_calm_1">A quiet day drifted off on the breeze. This stillness is lovely.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_calm_2">An uneventful day is a gift too. Take one deep breath.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_calm_3">On calm days, Haru rests right beside you.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_thanks_1">Gratitude always arrives, however far it goes.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_thanks_2">Knowing gratitude today makes you a little warmer.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_thanks_3">The wind will carry that thanks safely.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_disappoint_1">It hurt as much as you hoped. Let the wind take that weight now.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_disappoint_2">You tried, and that\'s not a fault. Today, this is enough.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_disappoint_3">Letdown is a passing cloud. The sky will clear again.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_sad_1">You sent your sadness away in one line. It\'s okay to cry; Haru is here.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_sad_2">You set a heavy heart down. Rest a little lighter tonight.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_sad_3">After rain, the garden grows greener. It will be okay, slowly.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_worry_1">Leave the worry to the wind, and stay with just this breath.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_worry_2">Most worries never come. It\'s okay to put this one down today.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_worry_3">Doing what you can is enough. The wind will take the rest.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_none_1">Today\'s line drifted away. You did well today.</string>
    <string name="letgo_msg_none_2">Well sent. Spend the rest of the day a little lighter.</string>
